cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "x0ne-Engine"
abstract: >-
  Confidential-native inference server in Rust: it refuses to serve outside a
  verified trusted execution environment (Intel TDX, NVIDIA confidential
  GPUs), reads the model key only after attestation, and signs a receipt
  per request that states the model digest, the enclave measurements and the
  absence of prefix cache, shared KV cache and cross-client batching.
authors:
  - name: "x0ne"
version: "0.2.0-beta.7"
license:
